      "claim": "F10 requires null and NullPointerException plus Maven builds and dependencies, but the intake gives neither row an adequate teaching vehicle and explicitly admits that pre-F10 coverage is partial. Learners would be asked to apply both fixed syllabus rows before they are taught.",
