          "section": "Class description: uses of null that produce NullPointerException",
          "retrievedAt": "2026-10-12T21:27:52Z",
          "textSha256": "e733abf770663daa9bff4e1dabe0f2362c50726b3f2179327045c2246f637690"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://maven.apache.org/guides/introduction/introduction-to-the-pom.html",
          "section": "Introduction to the POM: project model and dependencies",
          "retrievedAt": "2026-10-12T21:27:52Z",
          "textSha256": "14333f76b73290167069ef8a699dda5e7d5d91134e907c679055d10e2177b288"
        }
      ],
      "recommendation": "Do not change the syllabus. Bind both existing F10 rows to a concrete learner-facing F10 project brief/scaffold with observable outcomes and checks for null/NPE and a minimal Maven dependency declaration. If that artifact is platform-owned, name it and record acceptance evidence rather than treating HashMap null handling or running a supplied POM as coverage.",
